{"S": [{"i": 0, "t0": 0, "t1": 0.7, "text": "Qish.", "p": 0}, {"i": 1, "t0": 1.05, "t1": 2.976, "text": "Tashqarida minus o'n besh.", "p": 0}, {"i": 2, "t0": 3.326, "t1": 5.844, "text": "Soat kechasi o'n bir-u qirq yetti.", "p": 0}, {"i": 3, "t0": 6.194, "t1": 9.898, "text": "Sen choy ichib, telefonda video ko'rib o'tiribsan.", "p": 0}, {"i": 4, "t0": 10.248, "t1": 11.507, "text": "Va birdan — chiq.", "p": 0}, {"i": 5, "t0": 11.857, "t1": 12.746, "text": "Svet o'chdi.", "p": 0}, {"i": 6, "t0": 13.596, "t1": 15.226, "text": "Hech gap emas, deysan.", "p": 1}, {"i": 7, "t0": 15.576, "t1": 17.28, "text": "Bir-ikki soatda keladi.", "p": 1}, {"i": 8, "t0": 17.63, "t1": 19.111, "text": "Har qish shunaqa-ku.", "p": 1}, {"i": 9, "t0": 19.961, "t1": 22.109, "text": "Lekin bu safar svet kelmaydi.", "p": 2}, {"i": 10, "t0": 22.459, "t1": 23.274, "text": "Ertaga ham.", "p": 2}, {"i": 11, "t0": 23.624, "t1": 24.513, "text": "Indinga ham.", "p": 2}, {"i": 12, "t0": 24.863, "t1": 27.974, "text": "Butun O'zbekistonda — yetti kun svet yo'q.", "p": 2}, {"i": 13, "t0": 28.824, "t1": 34.898, "text": "Bugun kunma-kun ko'ramiz: uyingga, shahringga, tanangga va odamlarga nima bo'ladi.", "p": 3}, {"i": 14, "t0": 35.248, "t1": 40.137, "text": "Oxirida esa — hayotingni saqlab qolishi mumkin bo'lgan besh qoida.", "p": 3}, {"i": 15, "t0": 40.487, "t1": 44.635, "text": "Oxirigacha ko'r, bu bilim bir kun kerak bo'lishi mumkin.", "p": 3}, {"i": 16, "t0": 45.485, "t1": 46.448, "text": "Birinchi kun.", "p": 4}, {"i": 17, "t0": 46.798, "t1": 47.835, "text": "Birinchi soat.", "p": 4}, {"i": 18, "t0": 48.185, "t1": 53.148, "text": "Hamma bir xil ish qiladi: telefon fonarini yoqadi va sham qidiradi.", "p": 4}, {"i": 19, "t0": 53.498, "t1": 54.683, "text": "Sham topilmaydi.", "p": 4}, {"i": 20, "t0": 55.033, "t1": 56.737, "text": "Hech qachon topilmaydi.", "p": 4}, {"i": 21, "t0": 57.587, "t1": 59.735, "text": "Telefonda zaryad — qirq foiz.", "p": 5}, {"i": 22, "t0": 60.085, "t1": 61.419, "text": "Internet hali bor.", "p": 5}, {"i": 23, "t0": 61.769, "t1": 65.398, "text": "Hamma guruhlarga yozadi: «Sizlarda ham o'chdimi?»", "p": 5}, {"i": 24, "t0": 65.748, "t1": 67.081, "text": "— «Ha, bizda ham».", "p": 5}, {"i": 25, "t0": 67.931, "t1": 71.783, "text": "Lekin ikki-uch soatdan keyin internet ham yo'qoladi.", "p": 6}, {"i": 26, "t0": 72.133, "t1": 78.207, "text": "Chunki aloqa minoralarida ham akkumulyator bor — u bir necha soatga yetadi, xolos.", "p": 6}, {"i": 27, "t0": 78.557, "t1": 80.187, "text": "Keyin — «Tarmoq yo'q».", "p": 6}, {"i": 28, "t0": 80.537, "t1": 82.537, "text": "Endi sen dunyodan uzilding.", "p": 6}, {"i": 29, "t0": 83.387, "t1": 84.869, "text": "Endi eng qiziq joyi.", "p": 7}, {"i": 30, "t0": 85.219, "t1": 88.848, "text": "Ko'pchilik o'ylaydi: «Gaz bor-ku, issiq bo'ladi».", "p": 7}, {"i": 31, "t0": 89.198, "t1": 89.898, "text": "Yo'q.", "p": 7}, {"i": 32, "t0": 90.248, "t1": 95.73, "text": "Zamonaviy kotellar elektrsiz ishlamaydi — nasos ham, avtomatika ham tokda.", "p": 7}, {"i": 33, "t0": 96.08, "t1": 98.154, "text": "Gaz bor, lekin isitish yo'q.", "p": 7}, {"i": 34, "t0": 99.004, "t1": 105.004, "text": "Ko'p qavatli uylarda yana bir muammo: suvni yuqori qavatlarga nasoslar chiqaradi.", "p": 8}, {"i": 35, "t0": 105.354, "t1": 109.354, "text": "Nasos to'xtadi — beshinchi qavatdan yuqorida suv yo'q.", "p": 8}, {"i": 36, "t0": 109.704, "t1": 111.111, "text": "Lift ham to'xtagan.", "p": 8}, {"i": 37, "t0": 111.461, "t1": 113.831, "text": "Kimdir hozir liftda qolib ketdi.", "p": 8}, {"i": 38, "t0": 114.681, "t1": 115.644, "text": "Ikkinchi kun.", "p": 9}, {"i": 39, "t0": 115.994, "t1": 119.476, "text": "Ertalab uyg'onasan — uyda o'n bir daraja issiq.", "p": 9}, {"i": 40, "t0": 119.826, "t1": 121.752, "text": "Og'zingdan bug' chiqyapti.", "p": 9}, {"i": 41, "t0": 122.102, "t1": 125.065, "text": "Uy har soatda bir-ikki daraja soviyapti.", "p": 9}, {"i": 42, "t0": 125.915, "t1": 130.211, "text": "Va aynan shu yerda odamlar eng xavfli xatoga yo'l qo'yadi.", "p": 10}, {"i": 43, "t0": 131.061, "t1": 134.469, "text": "Gaz plitani yoqib, oshxona eshigini yopishadi.", "p": 11}, {"i": 44, "t0": 134.819, "t1": 136.004, "text": "«Isinib olamiz».", "p": 11}, {"i": 45, "t0": 136.354, "t1": 139.391, "text": "Yoki ko'mir manqalni uyga olib kirishadi.", "p": 11}, {"i": 46, "t0": 140.241, "t1": 141.204, "text": "Bu — is gazi.", "p": 12}, {"i": 47, "t0": 141.554, "t1": 143.85, "text": "Uning rangi ham, hidi ham yo'q.", "p": 12}, {"i": 48, "t0": 144.2, "t1": 145.533, "text": "Sen uni sezmaysan.", "p": 12}, {"i": 49, "t0": 145.883, "t1": 148.994, "text": "Avval boshing og'riydi, keyin uyqu bosadi…", "p": 12}, {"i": 50, "t0": 149.344, "t1": 150.9, "text": "va sen uxlab qolasan.", "p": 12}, {"i": 51, "t0": 151.25, "t1": 152.213, "text": "Uyg'onmaysan.", "p": 12}, {"i": 52, "t0": 153.063, "t1": 154.1, "text": "Bu ertak emas.", "p": 13}, {"i": 53, "t0": 154.45, "t1": 158.598, "text": "O'zbekistonda har qish is gazidan odamlar halok bo'ladi.", "p": 13}, {"i": 54, "t0": 158.948, "t1": 161.689, "text": "Ko'pincha — butun oila bilan, uyquda.", "p": 13}, {"i": 55, "t0": 162.539, "t1": 166.761, "text": "Birinchi qoida: gaz plita va manqal bilan uy isitilmaydi.", "p": 14}, {"i": 56, "t0": 167.111, "t1": 174.148, "text": "Agar baribir olov yoqsang — fortochka ochiq bo'lsin, va hech qachon olov yonib turganda uxlama.", "p": 14}, {"i": 57, "t0": 174.998, "t1": 176.331, "text": "Ko'chaga chiqasan.", "p": 15}, {"i": 58, "t0": 176.681, "t1": 177.941, "text": "Shahar boshqacha.", "p": 15}, {"i": 59, "t0": 178.291, "t1": 181.624, "text": "Svetoforlar o'chiq — chorrahalarda tiqilinch.", "p": 15}, {"i": 60, "t0": 181.974, "t1": 187.604, "text": "Benzin quyish shoxobchalari ham ishlamaydi — chunki nasoslar tokda ishlaydi.", "p": 15}, {"i": 61, "t0": 188.454, "t1": 191.343, "text": "Do'konga kirasan — terminal ishlamaydi.", "p": 16}, {"i": 62, "t0": 191.693, "t1": 193.174, "text": "Bankomat ishlamaydi.", "p": 16}, {"i": 63, "t0": 193.524, "t1": 197.08, "text": "Kartangda pul bor, lekin u endi hech narsa emas.", "p": 16}, {"i": 64, "t0": 197.43, "t1": 198.541, "text": "Faqat naqd pul.", "p": 16}, {"i": 65, "t0": 198.891, "t1": 203.113, "text": "Kimning cho'ntagida naqd pul bo'lsa — o'sha xarid qiladi.", "p": 16}, {"i": 66, "t0": 203.963, "t1": 208.259, "text": "Bir kunda do'konlarda sham, batareyka, suv va non tugaydi.", "p": 17}, {"i": 67, "t0": 209.109, "t1": 210.072, "text": "Uchinchi kun.", "p": 18}, {"i": 68, "t0": 210.422, "t1": 213.607, "text": "Uy endi tashqaridan unchalik farq qilmaydi.", "p": 18}, {"i": 69, "t0": 213.957, "t1": 216.476, "text": "Quvurlardagi suv muzlay boshlaydi.", "p": 18}, {"i": 70, "t0": 216.826, "t1": 219.567, "text": "Muz kengayadi — va quvurlar yoriladi.", "p": 18}, {"i": 71, "t0": 220.417, "t1": 222.194, "text": "Ichimlik suvi tugayapti.", "p": 19}, {"i": 72, "t0": 222.544, "t1": 224.396, "text": "Lekin tashqarida qor bor.", "p": 19}, {"i": 73, "t0": 224.746, "t1": 230.08, "text": "Qorni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri yeyish mumkin emas — tanangni ichidan sovutadi.", "p": 19}, {"i": 74, "t0": 230.43, "t1": 234.281, "text": "Uni idishga solib eritasan, imkon bo'lsa qaynatasan.", "p": 19}, {"i": 75, "t0": 235.131, "t1": 237.206, "text": "Muzlatgich ham ishlamayapti.", "p": 20}, {"i": 76, "t0": 237.556, "t1": 243.037, "text": "Lekin qishning bitta afzalligi bor: balkon — tabiatning bepul muzlatgichi.", "p": 20}, {"i": 77, "t0": 243.387, "t1": 245.535, "text": "Go'shtni balkonga chiqarasan.", "p": 20}, {"i": 78, "t0": 245.885, "t1": 248.107, "text": "Qish — ham dushman, ham do'st.", "p": 20}, {"i": 79, "t0": 248.957, "t1": 251.92, "text": "To'rtinchi kuni qiziq narsa ro'y beradi.", "p": 21}, {"i": 80, "t0": 252.27, "t1": 254.122, "text": "Odamlar ko'chaga chiqadi.", "p": 21}, {"i": 81, "t0": 254.472, "t1": 257.806, "text": "Qo'shnilar bir-biri bilan gaplasha boshlaydi.", "p": 21}, {"i": 82, "t0": 258.656, "t1": 261.767, "text": "Va bobolarimizning usullari yana tiriladi.", "p": 22}, {"i": 83, "t0": 262.117, "t1": 262.817, "text": "Sandal.", "p": 22}, {"i": 84, "t0": 263.167, "t1": 263.867, "text": "Tandir.", "p": 22}, {"i": 85, "t0": 264.217, "t1": 265.328, "text": "O'choqda qozon.", "p": 22}, {"i": 86, "t0": 265.678, "t1": 269.678, "text": "Hovlida o'tin yoqib, butun mahalla bitta osh damlaydi.", "p": 22}, {"i": 87, "t0": 270.528, "t1": 273.194, "text": "Sandal atrofida butun oila o'tiradi.", "p": 23}, {"i": 88, "t0": 273.544, "t1": 275.693, "text": "Telefon yo'q, televizor yo'q.", "p": 23}, {"i": 89, "t0": 276.043, "t1": 278.339, "text": "Bobo yoshligini gapirib beradi.", "p": 23}, {"i": 90, "t0": 278.689, "t1": 282.689, "text": "Ko'pchilik shunda birinchi marta haqiqatan gaplashadi.", "p": 23}, {"i": 91, "t0": 283.539, "t1": 286.65, "text": "Lekin bitta yangi xavf bor — mish-mishlar.", "p": 24}, {"i": 92, "t0": 287.0, "t1": 289.148, "text": "Internet yo'q, yangilik yo'q.", "p": 24}, {"i": 93, "t0": 289.498, "t1": 291.054, "text": "«Bir oy kelmas ekan».", "p": 24}, {"i": 94, "t0": 291.404, "t1": 293.478, "text": "«Hamma joyda shunaqa emish».", "p": 24}, {"i": 95, "t0": 293.828, "t1": 296.42, "text": "Qo'rquv sovuqdan ham tez tarqaladi.", "p": 24}, {"i": 96, "t0": 297.27, "t1": 300.752, "text": "Shuning uchun batareykali radio — oltinga teng.", "p": 25}, {"i": 97, "t0": 301.102, "t1": 304.139, "text": "Rasmiy xabarni faqat o'shandan eshitasan.", "p": 25}, {"i": 98, "t0": 304.989, "t1": 306.915, "text": "Beshinchi kun — eng og'ir.", "p": 26}, {"i": 99, "t0": 307.265, "t1": 310.82, "text": "Endi ko'zga ko'rinmas xavf: uy ichida sovqotish.", "p": 26}, {"i": 100, "t0": 311.67, "t1": 316.411, "text": "Tananing harorati o'ttiz beshdan pastga tushsa — bu gipotermiya.", "p": 27}, {"i": 101, "t0": 316.761, "t1": 318.094, "text": "Avval qaltiraysan.", "p": 27}, {"i": 102, "t0": 318.444, "t1": 321.111, "text": "Qaltirash — tananing ichki pechkasi.", "p": 27}, {"i": 103, "t0": 321.461, "t1": 326.202, "text": "Lekin qaltirash to'xtasa va hamon sovuq bo'lsa — bu yomon belgi.", "p": 27}, {"i": 104, "t0": 326.552, "t1": 329.885, "text": "Uyqu bosadi, hech narsa qiziq bo'lmay qoladi.", "p": 27}, {"i": 105, "t0": 330.735, "t1": 334.291, "text": "Eng xavf ostidagilar — keksalar va yosh bolalar.", "p": 28}, {"i": 106, "t0": 334.641, "t1": 336.493, "text": "Ular sovuqni kech sezadi.", "p": 28}, {"i": 107, "t0": 337.343, "t1": 341.12, "text": "Ikkinchi qoida: qo'shningdagi keksalardan xabar ol.", "p": 29}, {"i": 108, "t0": 341.47, "t1": 346.211, "text": "Bir termos issiq choy kimningdir hayotini saqlab qolishi mumkin.", "p": 29}, {"i": 109, "t0": 347.061, "t1": 350.765, "text": "Uchinchi qoida: butun oila bitta xonaga yig'iling.", "p": 30}, {"i": 110, "t0": 351.115, "t1": 353.189, "text": "Eng kichik xona — eng issiq.", "p": 30}, {"i": 111, "t0": 353.539, "t1": 357.909, "text": "Derazalarga ko'rpa iling, eshik tagini latta bilan to'sing.", "p": 30}, {"i": 112, "t0": 358.259, "t1": 363.222, "text": "Bosh kiyim kiying — issiqlikning katta qismi boshdan chiqib ketadi.", "p": 30}, {"i": 113, "t0": 364.072, "t1": 365.776, "text": "Yettinchi kuni ertalab.", "p": 31}, {"i": 114, "t0": 366.126, "t1": 369.311, "text": "Qayerdandir quvonchli qichqiriq eshitiladi.", "p": 31}, {"i": 115, "t0": 369.661, "t1": 372.031, "text": "Derazalar birin-ketin yorishadi.", "p": 31}, {"i": 116, "t0": 372.381, "t1": 373.196, "text": "Svet keldi!", "p": 31}, {"i": 117, "t0": 374.046, "t1": 375.083, "text": "Lekin shoshma.", "p": 32}, {"i": 118, "t0": 375.433, "t1": 377.581, "text": "Eng xavfli lahza aynan hozir.", "p": 32}, {"i": 119, "t0": 377.931, "t1": 383.857, "text": "Butun shahar bir vaqtda hamma narsani yoqadi: isitgichlar, kotellar, choynaklar.", "p": 32}, {"i": 120, "t0": 384.207, "t1": 388.578, "text": "Tarmoq ko'tarolmaydi — svet yana o'chadi, texnikang kuyadi.", "p": 32}, {"i": 121, "t0": 389.428, "t1": 394.909, "text": "To'rtinchi qoida: svet o'chganda hamma texnikani rozetkadan sug'urib qo'y.", "p": 33}, {"i": 122, "t0": 395.259, "t1": 398.296, "text": "Kelganda — ularni birin-ketin, sekin yoq.", "p": 33}, {"i": 123, "t0": 399.146, "t1": 402.924, "text": "Xullas, yetti kun svetsiz qanday omon qolish kerak.", "p": 34}, {"i": 124, "t0": 403.774, "t1": 404.474, "text": "Birinchi.", "p": 35}, {"i": 125, "t0": 404.824, "t1": 409.343, "text": "Gaz plita va manqal bilan isitma — is gazi jimgina o'ldiradi.", "p": 35}, {"i": 126, "t0": 410.193, "t1": 410.893, "text": "Ikkinchi.", "p": 36}, {"i": 127, "t0": 411.243, "t1": 413.391, "text": "Keksa qo'shnilardan xabar ol.", "p": 36}, {"i": 128, "t0": 414.241, "t1": 414.941, "text": "Uchinchi.", "p": 37}, {"i": 129, "t0": 415.291, "t1": 419.587, "text": "Hammangiz bitta kichik xonaga yig'iling va issiq kiyining.", "p": 37}, {"i": 130, "t0": 420.437, "t1": 421.252, "text": "To'rtinchi.", "p": 38}, {"i": 131, "t0": 421.602, "t1": 425.231, "text": "Texnikani o'chirib qo'y, svet kelganda sekin yoq.", "p": 38}, {"i": 132, "t0": 426.081, "t1": 426.822, "text": "Beshinchi.", "p": 39}, {"i": 133, "t0": 427.172, "t1": 434.061, "text": "Uyda doim zaxira bo'lsin: fonar, batareykalar, powerbank, naqd pul, suv va batareykali radio.", "p": 39}, {"i": 134, "t0": 434.911, "t1": 438.837, "text": "Bularning hammasi bitta oylik internet pulidan arzon.", "p": 40}, {"i": 135, "t0": 439.187, "t1": 442.965, "text": "Lekin bir kun kelib, aynan shular oilangni asraydi.", "p": 40}, {"i": 136, "t0": 443.815, "t1": 448.407, "text": "Endi izohlarda yozing: sizda eng uzoq svet necha soat o'chgan?", "p": 41}, {"i": 137, "t0": 448.757, "t1": 451.054, "text": "Va o'sha paytda nima qilgansiz?", "p": 41}, {"i": 138, "t0": 451.404, "t1": 454.885, "text": "Eng qiziq hikoyalarni keyingi videoda o'qiyman.", "p": 41}, {"i": 139, "t0": 455.735, "t1": 460.994, "text": "Videoni bir yaqiningga yubor — bu bilim unga ham kerak bo'lishi mumkin.", "p": 42}, {"i": 140, "t0": 461.844, "t1": 463.4, "text": "Layk bos, obuna bo'l.", "p": 43}, {"i": 141, "t0": 463.75, "t1": 465.972, "text": "Keyingi videoda ko'rishguncha.", "p": 43}, {"i": 142, "t0": 466.322, "t1": 467.433, "text": "Issiq kiyining!", "p": 43}], "provisional": true}